    <briefdescription>
<para>Tests NV2A bump mapping using various texture formats, orientations, and signed/unsigned component filtering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Exercises bump mapping via projective 2D and dot product / bumpenvmap shader stages. Tests standard 8-bit du/dv bump mapping with G8B8, R6G5B5, and other formats across combinations of signed and unsigned coordinates, 90-degree rotations, and cross-channel mappings. Also exercises 16-bit HILO bump mapping using NV097_SET_TEXTURE_FORMAT_COLOR_SZ_YB_16_YA_16 and NV097_SET_TEXTURE_FORMAT_COLOR_LU_IMAGE_YB16YA16. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
